<title>UK: WestLB Finance sets $200 million bond due Dec 2000.</title>
<headline>WestLB Finance sets $200 million bond due Dec 2000.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CIBC Wood Gundy.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTLB FINANCE CURACAO</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    29.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.72    PAY DATE   S10.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.32     SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1(GTOR) LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+(GTOR) DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE/NETH ANT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
